note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/ng/multi_target/vendor_targets.om:
note Universal Multi-Vendor GPU & Cross-Platform 1.0 Target Matrix for Omega NG.
note
note Library unit for program mode (no om2 line, no fn main; prefix mt_ / MT_).
note Links after seed/ng/target/target_desc.om (compatible with both OM-1 and OM-2 concatenation).
note
note Provides:
note   1. Complete 24-field TargetDesc profiles in tdTable[0..15]:
note      - Existing 0..9: Grace X925, Grace A725, x86-64 AVX2, x86-64 AVX-512,
note        RV64GC+RVV, Cortex-M55, GB10 SM121, Ethos-U55, APU-GB10, Spark Ring.
note      - Added 10..15: RTX 5090 (sm_120), AMD MI300X (gfx942), AMD Strix Halo (gfx1151),
note        Intel Arc Xe2 (drm/xe), Apple M-series (a64macos), Universal Tier-0 (SPIR-V/WASM).
note      - Explicit platform & honest evidence registry separating HOST_VERIFIED / EMULATED
note        from PHYSICAL_SILICON (never inflating unrun silicon beyond NOT_RUN).
note   2. 3-Tier Universal Realization Router (mt_route):
note      - Tier-2 Bare-Metal (aienux / a64efi)
note      - Tier-1 Zero-SDK Native (nvrm / kfd / drm-xe / native ELF & Mach-O)
note      - Tier-0 Universal Interop (SPIR-V / WASM)
note      - Strict fail-closed contract checks + explicit non-silent fallback/refusal reasons.
note   3. Pure-Omega Silicon Probe & Auto-Calibrator (mt_probe_local):
note      - Probes live local CPU core (cpunow), MIDR_EL1, L1D/L2 sysfs caches,
note        multi-core heterogeneous topology, /proc/cpuinfo ISA features, WSL 2 marker,
note        and read-only faccess device-node presence (never opens any GPU device!).
note      - Matches live host silicon to the exact TargetDesc row and calibrates tile plan.
note   4. x86-64 execpure seccomp-BPF Policy Builder (mt_x64_execpure_spec) +
note      cBPF Structural Verifier (mt_bpf_verify) + cBPF VM Evaluator (mt_bpf_eval):
note      - Emits exact 27-insn (216-byte) AUDIT_ARCH_X86_64 (0xc000003e) stdio-only filter
note        with 64-bit upper-half argument checks and SECCOMP_RET_KILL_PROCESS default,
note        plus companion x86-64 UAPI syscall & prlimit64 spec table for omc.om lowering.

